      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRACE ELLA NZ (3) is a progressive filly who led to win here two back then settled handy and finished strongly to score again last start at Bunbury, getting there by 2.2 metres. Likely to get the favours from this nice draw so could land the hat trick. A PRECIOUS GEM (8) has been racing well of late. Draws wider than when fourth at her latest appearance but did a great job to come from the back row and place in the WA Oaks prior. Could grab that well-deserved win. NOT SO SWEET (1) has been coming from wider or second line barriers so could be a big improver from the ace draw. CINCH NZ (7) is worth including again after placing in her last three outings.",
